        "id": 1081395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-02-08T00:17:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there an overall design for blacklist management?  The fact that it is maintained here and used in network selector, this is feeling really convoluted.  do we have a plan of attack to fix this?  Is there an alternate way to deal with this here so we don\u0027t have to go back and forth between instances?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7055,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 7055,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "21e02eaf79bdcf8ea9e22307364116636ca0bf05",
